  "description": "Former national archer Hwang Jung-Ho was forced to retire after an injury turned his shoulder into a hypersensitive weakness. Avoiding touch and attention, he now lives quietly as a delivery driver. That is, until a delivery brings him face to face with rising archery star Kang Jun-Hyuk—who grabs Jung-Ho’s shoulder and triggers an overwhelming reaction.\n\n *“If this is because of me... I’ll take help you...!”*\n\nWhat kind of “help” is Jun-Hyuk offering—and can Jung-Ho resist him?\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)\n\n*Note: Includes four extra chapters.*",
